 "summary": "The coefficient-naturality theorem for the tensor-induced diagonal class, the degree-preservation theorem and the differential-commutation theorem have no existing equivalent in Mathlib or TauCeti; the existing coeffMap_* lemmas cover only transitivity, change of transversal, or untensored classes. The proofs reuse existing lemmas (smoothGradedResolutionFunctor_map, gradedResolutionTopRepMap_apply, PiTensorProduct.isHomogeneous_map, slotSum_comp_map, augmentation naturality, ResolutionContraction.map_gradedCohomologyClass) rather than re-deriving them.",
